* MAX402 FAMILY MACROMODELS
* 
*
* FEATURES:
* High gain-bandwidth at low supply current (>10MHz/mA)
* Supply Voltage ---------------  +- 3V to +-5V
* Offset Voltage ---------------  2.0mV max.
* Input Bias Current -----------  +/- 5nA max. (MAX402/403)
*                                 +/- 25nA max. (MAX438/439)
*
* PART NUMBER    DESCRIPTION
* __________     ______________________________________________
*  MAX402        2MHz GBW,   75uA Idd, Av=1 stable,  7V/uS slew
*  MAX403        10MHz GBW, 375uA Idd, Av=1 stable, 40V/uS slew
*  MAX438        6MHz GBW,   75uA Idd, Av>=5 min.,  10V/uS slew
*  MAX439        25MHz GBW, 375uA Idd, Av>=5 min.,  48V/uS slew
*
*
*  ////////////// MAX439 MACROMODEL //////////////////
*
*  ====> MAX439 MUST BE OPERATED CLOSED-LOOP GAIN
*        OF 5V/V OR GREATER TO ensure STABILITY   <====
* connections:          non-inverting input
*                       |      inverting input
*                       |      |      positive power-supply
*                       |      |      |    negative power-supply
*                       |      |      |      |       output
*                       |      |      |      |       |
* NODE CONNECTIONS:     1      2      99     50      97
*
.SUBCKT MAX439 1 2 99 50 97
****************INPUT STAGE**********************
IOS 2 1 0N
I1 4 50 250E-6
GIN 2 1 2 1 1E-9
R1 5 99 500
R2 6 99 500
EOS 1 9 POLY(1) 98 30  0.5M 1
*               ^       OFFSET VOLTAGE, NODE 30 FROM COM. MODE STAGE.
Q1 5 2 103 QX
Q2 6 9 104 QX
REE1 104 4 500
REE2 103 4 500
* Second Pole
C4 5 6 13PF
***************SECOND STAGE******************
*IS 99 50 .5m
*  SETS IS ^
****OUTPUT VOLTAGE LIMITING****
V2 99 11 1.61
D1 12 11 DX
D2 10 12 DX
V3 10 50 1.61
****LEVEL TRANSLATION ****
EH 99 98 99 50 0.5
****GAIN, 1ST POLE****
G3 98 12 5 6 9.16e-4
R4 12 98 10.9E+6
C3 98 12 2.1PF
****COMMON-MODE STAGE****
G11 98 30 104 98 1E-7
R13 30 98 1E3
*
*******************OUTPUT STAGE****************
F6 99 50 VA7 1
F5 99 38 VA8 1
D9 40 38 DX
D10 38 99 DX
VA7 99 40 0
****************
G12 98 32 12 98 1E-3
R15 98 32 1E3
D3 32 36 DX
D4 37 32 DX
V5 35 37 -0.3V
V4 36 35 -0.3V
R16 34 35 200 
E1 99 33 99 32 1
VA8 33 34 0V
L 35 97 0.5U
RL 35 97 10MEG
*
***** MODELS USED ******
.MODEL DX D(IS=1E-15)
.MODEL QX NPN(BF=25000)
.ENDS
